# user-dropped Guitar Pro files used for local testing — never committed,
# per the no-hosting-rule skill (PlainChord doesn't host copyrighted content).
# Recursive (**), not just public/*.gp3 — real test batches land in their
# own subfolders (public/gp3/, public/GP5/, ...), and a flat pattern here
# would silently miss every file one directory deeper.
public/**/*.gp3
public/**/*.gp4
public/**/*.gp5
public/**/*.gpx
public/**/*.filepart
